    "개념과 설명·출처가 삭제됩니다. 조회 기록은 남지만 개념과의 연결은 해제돼요. 되돌릴 수 없어요." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The concept, its explanation, and its sources will be deleted. Lookup history remains but is detached from the concept. This can't be undone." } },
